flowchart TD
    A[Conversation] --> B[Important fact or decision]
    B --> C[Record outside the conversation]
    C --> D[Add exact source and boundary]
    D --> E[Label confidence and uncertainty]
    E --> F[Create compact handoff]
    F --> G[Continue in a new conversation]
    G --> H[Compare response with the record]
    H --> I[Approve or correct]

